  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et prohibemus ne aliquis extra vendatur. Si quis hoc praesumat, sit praeter benedictionem Die et omnium sanctorum et praeter omnem Christianitatem, nisi peniteat et emendet, sicut episcopus suus edocebit.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we forbid that anyone be sold out of the country. If anyone dares to do so, he shall be shut out from the blessing of God and of all the Saints, and from all share in the Christian religion, unless he repents and makes amends as his bishop shall direct.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
